!id roles
each unit type will have one or more  roles for ai to understand how to use. for example elkriders or horsemen both might be considered cavalry. so that addition of new units wont confuse the ai.

something like a horse archer can also be used both as ranged or cavalry. so Ai will decide in what way to use it

!id cavalry
Cavalry should only has these jobs: 
1- being hammer to anvil. 
2 - taking out routers that it can catch. 
3- catching open (but not obvious trap, no nearby friendlies) archers. 
4- acting as reserves and prevention of flanking by enemy cavalry.

